WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.667
-And finally, guys,
it's Wednesday.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.767
You know what that means.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:06.133
It's time for some
Monday Motivations.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.467
-Monday Motivations.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.567
-Secretly, the Kardashians
are just trying

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:14.834
to keep up with you.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.934
[ Applause ]

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.934
Every time you have
an appointment,

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:22.434
your dentist
calls his friends like,

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.801
"You'll never guess where
my hand is right now.

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:26.901
Yes, Jeffrey's mouth!"

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:30.133
[ Applause ]

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.234
When people see you in a club,
they're like,

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.734
"Whoa, how'd I get into
the VIP section?"

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:38.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.200
You wore a winter coat
last week,

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.868
and now everyone's wearing
a winter coat.

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.534
That can't be a coincidence.

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:46.934
Congratulations, trendsetter.

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:49.634
[ Applause ]

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:54.868
Every time people see you,
they're like,

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.033
"Mistletoe?"

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:02.467
When you go down the line
and say what you want

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.267
at Chipotle,
the workers are like,

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:06.501
"Right answer. Right answer."

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:09.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:13.467
And finally, you're the "you"
Mariah keeps saying

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:14.801
that she wants for Christmas.

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:16.801
That's why they play it
every time

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.834
you go into the CVS!

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:20.934
All she wants is you!

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.801
[ Cheering ]

